        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>第2课时 分数的加法和减法 练习课</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    background: #f2f2ee;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 950px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fbfbf7;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding: 25px 35px 40px 35px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n  }\n  .top-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #444;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    margin: 10px 0 20px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .left-col, .right-col {\n    width: 50%;\n    padding: 0 15px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    border-left: 2px dashed #b33;\n    margin: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .section-num {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .question {\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .red {\n    color: #c0272d;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 18px;\n  }\n  .frac {\n    display: inline-block;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .frac .num {\n    display: block;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #222;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .frac .den {\n    display: block;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .frac.red .num, .frac.red .den {\n    color: #c0272d;\n  }\n  .frac.red .num {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #c0272d;\n  }\n  .calc-grid {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .calc-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .calc-line {\n    border-top: 1px solid #333;\n    width: 70%;\n    margin: 4px auto;\n  }\n  .match-section {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .box-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    margin: 12px 0;\n  }\n  .box {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    min-width: 55px;\n  }\n  .result-box {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 5px 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #c0272d;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    min-width: 70px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px;\n    margin: 8px auto;\n    background: #f7f7f2;\n  }\n  .page-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-top: 25px;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    background: #6b6bb0;\n    color: white;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"top-header\">6&nbsp;&nbsp;分数的加法和减法</div>\n  <div class=\"title\">第 2 课时&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;第 1 课时练习课</div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n\n      <div class=\"section-num\">1.填一填</div>\n\n      <div class=\"question\">\n        (1) $\\dfrac{4}{11}+\\dfrac{5}{11}$ 表示（<span class=\"red\">4</span>）个 $\\dfrac{1}{11}$ 加上（<span class=\"red\">5</span>）个\n        $\\dfrac{1}{11}$，是（<span class=\"red\">9</span>）个 $\\dfrac{1}{11}$，就是（<span class=\"red\">9/11</span>）。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"question\">\n        (2) 计算 $\\dfrac{3}{2}-\\dfrac{1}{4}$ 时，因为两个分数（<span class=\"red\">分母</span>）\n        不同，不能直接相减，所以应先通分，化成（<span class=\"red\">同分母</span>）分数再相减。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"question\">\n        (3) 比 $\\dfrac{4}{5}$ m 长 $\\dfrac{3}{8}$ m 的是（<span class=\"red\">47/40</span>）m。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"question\">\n        (4) 分数单位是 $\\dfrac{1}{12}$ 的最简真分数有\n        <span class=\"red\">1/12，5/12，7/12，11/12</span>，它们的和是（<span class=\"red\">2</span>）。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-num\">2.算一算</div>\n      <div class=\"calc-grid\">\n        <div class=\"calc-col\">\n          $\\dfrac{5}{8}$<br>\n          <span class=\"red\">$=\\dfrac{15}{24}$</span><br>\n          $-\\dfrac{1}{3}$<br>\n          <span class=\"red\">$=\\dfrac{14}{24}$</span>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\"></div>\n          <span class=\"red\">$\\dfrac{1}{24}$</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"calc-col\">\n          $\\dfrac{1}{4}$<br>\n          <span class=\"red\">$=\\dfrac{5}{12}$</span><br>\n          $+\\dfrac{5}{12}$\n          <div class=\"calc-line\"></div>\n          <span class=\"red\">$\\dfrac{10}{12}=\\dfrac{5}{6}$</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"calc-col\">\n          $\\dfrac{2}{9}$<br>\n          $+\\dfrac{5}{6}$<br>\n          <span class=\"red\">$=\\dfrac{4}{18}+\\dfrac{15}{18}$</span>\n          <div class=\"calc-line\"></div>\n          <span class=\"red\">$\\dfrac{19}{18}$</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"calc-grid\">\n        <div class=\"calc-col\">\n          $\\dfrac{1}{4}$<br>\n          $+\\dfrac{7}{12}$\n          <div class=\"calc-line\"></div>\n          <span class=\"red\">$\\dfrac{10}{12}=\\dfrac{5}{6}$</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"calc-col\">\n          $\\dfrac{3}{10}$<br>\n          $+\\dfrac{7}{15}$\n          <div class=\"calc-line\"></div>\n          <span class=\"red\">$\\dfrac{23}{30}$</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"calc-col\">\n          $\\dfrac{2}{9}$<br>\n          $+\\dfrac{5}{24}$\n          <div class=\"calc-line\"></div>\n          <span class=\"red\">[?]</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-num\">3.连一连</div>\n      <div class=\"match-section\">\n        <div class=\"box-row\">\n          <div class=\"box\">$\\dfrac{3}{5}+\\dfrac{4}{7}$</div>\n          <div class=\"box\">$\\dfrac{1}{2}+\\dfrac{3}{7}$</div>\n          <div class=\"box\">$\\dfrac{7}{10}-\\dfrac{5}{6}$</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"box-row\">\n          <div class=\"result-box\">结果大于1</div>\n          <div class=\"result-box\">结果小于1</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:40px;line-height:40px;\">[手绘连线：三个算式分别与\"结果大于1\"或\"结果小于1\"用红线连接，并延伸至下方分数框]</div>\n        <div class=\"box-row\">\n          <div class=\"box\">2/3，<br>4/9</div>\n          <div class=\"box\">22/27，<br>2/3</div>\n          <div class=\"box\">9/14，<br>6/14</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n\n      <div class=\"section-num\">4.一个西瓜，第一次吃了它的 $\\dfrac{1}{3}$，第二次吃</div>\n      <div class=\"question\">了它的 $\\dfrac{2}{5}$。</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent\">(1) 两次一共吃了它的几分之几？</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent red\">$\\dfrac{1}{3}+\\dfrac{2}{5}=\\dfrac{11}{15}$</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent\">(2) 这个西瓜还剩下几分之几？</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent red\">$1-\\dfrac{11}{15}=\\dfrac{4}{15}$</div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-num\">5.春天到了，某学校的同学去郊区植树，四</div>\n      <div class=\"question\">年级同学植了总棵数的 $\\dfrac{3}{8}$，五年级同学植</div>\n      <div class=\"question\">了总棵数的 $\\dfrac{3}{5}$。</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent\">(1) 两个年级一共植了总棵数的几分</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent\">之几？</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent red\">$\\dfrac{3}{8}+\\dfrac{3}{5}=\\dfrac{39}{40}$</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent\">(2) 你还能提出什么数学问题并解答？</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent red\">五年级同学比四年级同学多种了总棵数的几分之几?</div>\n      <div class=\"question indent red\">$\\dfrac{3}{5}-\\dfrac{3}{8}=\\dfrac{9}{40}$</div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-num\">6.佳佳做数学作业用了 $\\dfrac{2}{5}$ 小时，比做语文作</div>\n      <div class=\"question\">业少用 $\\dfrac{1}{4}$ 小时，佳佳做这两科作业一共用</div>\n      <div class=\"question\">了多长时间？</div>\n      <div class=\"question red\">$\\dfrac{2}{5}+\\dfrac{1}{4}=\\dfrac{13}{20}$（时）</div>\n      <div class=\"question red\">$\\dfrac{2}{5}+\\dfrac{13}{20}=\\dfrac{21}{20}$（时）</div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-footer\">\n    <div class=\"page-num\">69</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
